  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>A large version of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pulse-Wave_Pistol\" title=\"Pulse-Wave Pistol\">Pulse-Wave Pistol</a>, the Pulse-Wave Rifle operates on the same principles as its smaller cousin. Pulse-Wave Rifles grant a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to damage rolls at Point-Blank <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p><p>A Pulse-Wave Rifle requires a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;to operate. After 50 shots, the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;must be replaced. </p><p><b>Inaccurate:</b>&nbsp;This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
